.github.com/repos/python/mypy/labels/good-first-issue","name":"good-first-issue","color":"3dc136","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2018-11-16T12:51:35Z","updated_at":"2019-08-07T18:19:24Z","closed_at":"2019-08-07T18:19:24Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Consider the following snippet:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass A:\r\n    @property\r\n    def x(self):\r\n        self.y = 'y'\r\n        return 'x'\r\n\r\nclass B:\r\n    @property\r\n    def x(self):\r\n        return 'x'\r\n\r\n    @x.setter\r\n    def x(self, value):\r\n        self.y = 'y'\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe stub generated via `stubgen` contains:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n\r\n# Stubs for tests.m (Python 3.6)\r\n#\r\n# NOTE: This dynamically typed stub was automatically generated by stubgen.\r\n\r\nfrom typing import Any\r\n\r\nclass A:\r\n    @property\r\n    y: str = ...\r\n    def x(self): ...\r\n\r\nclass B:\r\n    @property\r\n    def x(self): ...\r\n    @x.setter\r\n    y: str = ...\r\n    def x(self, value: Any) -> None: ...\r\n```\r\n\r\nNotice the instance field type declarations are being placed between the decorator and the function declaration lines.\r\n\r\nI can reproduce this issue using the latest `mypy` installed from the `master` branch:\r\n```sh\r\n$ pip show mypy | grep Version\r\nVersion: 0.650+dev.9459c7544f9adedb509d92e211f300e573cb6844\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"msullivan","id":340349,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDM0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/340349?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msullivan","html_url":"https://github.com/msullivan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msullivan/followers","following_url":"https://a